  "findings_and_fixes": [
    "FOR UPDATE requires an UPDATE RLS policy path for the RPC owner; the added policy remains scoped to the current owner/member relationship.",
    "RPC insert/update operations require narrowly scoped RLS and column grants for bunch, praise, receipt, and notice rows while authenticated callers retain no direct product DML.",
